<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7281] .NET: Services do not work on .NET Core</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7281</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We rely on &lt;tt&gt;System.Runtime.Remoting.Proxies.RealProxy&lt;/tt&gt; for dynamic proxy generation. However, remoting is not supported on .NET Core.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Investigate whether we can get rid of RealProxy and generate runtime proxies manually. Basically, we need to emit an interface implementation where every method just delegates to our code.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13126538">IGNITE-7281</key>
            <summary>.NET: Services do not work on .NET Core</summary>
