By the way, there are two messages from you on the dev list:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
