                            <comment id="16315002" author="rokhin" created="Sat, 6 Jan 2018 23:37:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Seems it is not possible to override non-virtual object.GetType() method as TransparentProxy does.&lt;br/&gt;
And there are some tests that test equality of proxy&apos;s type and interface type.&lt;br/&gt;
Do we really need that equality?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16318031" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 9 Jan 2018 08:36:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rokhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rokhin&quot;&gt;rokhin&lt;/a&gt; I don&apos;t think we need this, let&apos;s remove these tests.&lt;br/&gt;
By the way, please click &quot;Start Progress&quot; when working on the ticket, then &quot;Submit Patch&quot; when done.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
